# =============================================================================
# Authentik OIDC Integration for Jellyfin & Jellyseerr
# =============================================================================
# Configures both Jellyfin and Jellyseerr to use Authentik for SSO.
#
# Jellyfin requires the SSO-Auth plugin:
# - Install from: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/9p4/jellyfin-plugin-sso/manifest-release/manifest.json
