in the custom css code, i currently have this:
@import url("https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/lscambo13/ElegantFin@main/Theme/ElegantFin-jellyfin-theme-build-latest-minified.css");

for the theme. How do i add our new disclaimer theme?

Just append the new CSS rules after your existing `@import` statement. The `@import` must stay at the top, then add the disclaimer styles below:

```css
@import url("https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/lscambo13/ElegantFin@main/Theme/ElegantFin-jellyfin-theme-build-latest-minified.css");

.disclaimerContainer {
  display: block;
}

a.raised.emby-button {
  padding: 0.9em 1em;
  color: inherit !important;
}
```

That's it - the `@import` loads ElegantFin theme first, then the disclaimer styles are applied on top.

